id: pmc-kd73
title: The installed pm resolver's memo makes three untested failures appear and disappear from exact coverage
description: "The module-level resolvedPmCommand memo means installed pm resolution runs at most once per process. No test directly drives the missing-bin, missing-target, or resolver-failure paths, so Node 22 worker scheduling can change whether V8 counts their untaken branches and make an unchanged exact-coverage gate alternate between red and green."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 0
tags[5]: coverage,determinism,node22,release-gate,test-quality
created_at: "2026-09-01T08:25:40.470Z"
updated_at: "2026-09-01T08:39:46.937Z"
closed_at: "2026-09-01T08:39:46.456Z"
completed_at: "2026-09-01T08:39:46.456Z"
author: pi-agent
estimated_minutes: 90
acceptance_criteria: "Introduce an injectable installed-command resolution seam while preserving production memoization and default behavior; directly assert missing bin, nonexistent target, and resolver failure; prove default no-PATH execution; run coverage at least three times on Node 22.23.1 and once on default Node; pass all repository gates."
risk: high
confidence: high
severity: high
environment: Node 22.23.1 coverage gate with test files scheduled across workers
repro_steps: Run npm run coverage repeatedly under Node 22.23.1 and inspect src/generator.ts lines in the installed pm resolution branch.
resolution: "Extracted installed pm command resolution behind a complete injectable dependency boundary. Direct tests cover missing bin, nonexistent target, and resolver wrapping without touching the process memo; readPmItems retains one-time production memoization and its no-PATH integration test proves the real manifest, filesystem, current Node executable, and installed CLI defaults."
expected_result: Every identical run directly covers all installed pm resolution guards and reports deterministic 100 percent line branch and function coverage.
actual_result: Three consecutive Node 22.23.1 coverage runs and one default Node 26.5.0 run report generator.ts and aggregate at exact 100/100/100. All focused tests execute exactly one named test and mutation checks kill removal of each protected path.
fixed_version: 2026.8.31
component: src/generator.ts installed pm command resolution
customer_impact: A mandatory gate can reject unchanged input nondeterministically and obscure genuinely untested error handling.
notes[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-01T08:26:20.075Z",pi-agent,"Root cause confirmed before mutation: src/generator.ts holds resolvedPmCommand at module scope and only enters installed-command resolution while it is undefined, so the block runs at most once per process. Repository search found readPmItems tests with explicit pmBin plus one default-resolution integration case, but no targeted assertion for a manifest without bin, a nonexistent resolved target, or a thrown package resolver. Thus coverage attribution for the untaken guards can depend on whether a worker enters the memoized block."
  "2026-09-01T08:30:55.591Z",pi-agent,"Mutation verification killed all three guard removals: deleting the missing-bin guard made its exact diagnostic assertion fail; deleting the path-existence guard produced Missing expected exception; replacing the wrapping catch with a raw rethrow made the Error-and-cause assertion fail. Each focused run reported tests 1, pass 0, fail 1, proving the behavioral assertions—not incidental coverage—protect each path."
  "2026-09-01T08:39:45.522Z",pi-agent,"Determinism evidence: with PATH prefixed to Node v22.23.1, three consecutive npm run coverage executions passed; generator.ts and aggregate each reported 100.00 lines, 100.00 branches, and 100.00 functions on runs 1, 2, and 3. The default Node v26.5.0 run also passed with generator.ts and aggregate at 100.00/100.00/100.00. The full code gate then passed 544 tests with 544 pass and 0 fail, exact generator and aggregate coverage, and 184 documented declarations; pm health strict also returned ok true."
files[4]{path,scope,note}:
  dist/generator.d.ts,project,generated declarations
  dist/generator.js,project,generated runtime output
  src/generator.ts,project,injectable installed pm resolver and production memo boundary
  test/generator.test.ts,project,direct resolver failures and default no-PATH integration
